      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight woven-look fabric with a soft, breezy drape; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A gentle lavender mother-daughter dress moment for garden photos, birthdays, vacations, and sunny weekends.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Color reference:</strong> Lavender Meadow is a soft solid lilac-purple shade that keeps the look sweet, simple, and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Short sleeves, round neckline, gathered waist, and an easy twirl skirt shown for both mom and daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Child 2 Years through Child 9-10 Years, plus Mother S through Mother 2XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or \u2014 (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 2 Years</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10-13 kg / 22-28.7 lbs</td>\n<td>80-90 cm / 31.5-35.4 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.3 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>49 cm / 19.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>13-15.5 kg / 28.7-34.2 lbs</td>\n<td>90-100 cm / 35.4-39.4 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>53 cm / 20.9 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>53 cm / 20.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>14.5-19.5 kg / 32-43 lbs</td>\n<td>100-110 cm / 39.4-43.3 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26 in</td>\n<td>62 cm / 24.4 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 5 Years</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>21.5-26.5 kg / 47.4-58.4 lbs</td>\n<td>110-120 cm / 43.3-47.2 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26 in</td>\n<td>61 cm / 24 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 6-7 Years</td>\n<td>6-7</td>\n<td>26.5-30 kg / 58.4-66.1 lbs</td>\n<td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>65 cm / 25.6 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>65 cm / 25.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>29-35 kg / 63.9-77.2 lbs</td>\n<td>130-140 cm / 51.2-55.1 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>74 cm / 29.1 in</td>\n<td>70 cm / 27.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>34.5-42.5 kg / 76.1-93.7 lbs</td>\n<td>140-150 cm / 55.1-59.1 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>82 cm / 32.3 in</td>\n<td>78 cm / 30.7 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>42.5-47.5 kg / 93.7-104.7 lbs</td>\n<td>155-160 cm / 61-63 in</td>\n<td>86 cm / 33.9 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>80 cm / 31.5 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>47.5-55 kg / 104.7-121.3 lbs</td>\n<td>158-163 cm / 62.2-64.2 in</td>\n<td>90 cm / 35.4 in</td>\n<td>97 cm / 38.2 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>84 cm / 33.1 in</td>\n<td>97 cm / 38.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>55-60 kg / 121.3-132.3 lbs</td>\n<td>161-168 cm / 63.4-66.1 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>88 cm / 34.6 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>60-67.5 kg / 132.3-148.8 lbs</td>\n<td>163-170 cm / 64.2-66.9 in</td>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>99 cm / 39 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>92 cm / 36.2 in</td>\n<td>99 cm / 39 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>67.5-75 kg / 148.8-165.3 lbs</td>\n<td>165-173 cm / 65-68.1 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>\u2014</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Lavender Meadow keeps mommy-and-me dressing soft and effortless. The matching solid lavender dresses feel polished enough for photos while staying easy for outdoor parties, family trips, and warm-weather weekends.</p>\n\n<p>The attached vendor chart supports girl and mother dress rows only, so this draft keeps the listing focused on the mother-daughter dress set. Every size shown in the picker is backed by a row from the supplied chart.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Mother-daughter match:</strong> Girl and Mother dress sizes are listed from the vendor chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft lavender color:</strong> A solid lilac-purple shade that is easy to style for spring and summer photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Twirl-friendly shape:</strong> Gathered waist and fuller skirt silhouette give the dresses gentle movement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Short-sleeve comfort:</strong> Round neckline and short sleeves keep the look simple and wearable.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only review:</strong> Created unpublished so merchandising can confirm fabric and image readiness before launch.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your matching sizes and create a soft lavender mommy-and-me dress look for the next family memory.</p>",
